## Honesty note on benchmarks

Every number in `docs/04-benchmarks.md` is from a single machine (`RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96 GB`,
Windows 10 19045, driver 616.92) and is reported with its measurement conditions. Numbers measured
before 2026-11-19 were, in several cases, later shown to be contaminated by prompt overlap with the
training corpus — see `docs/06-postmortem.md` §"评测污染". Where a claim was retracted, both the
original and the retraction are kept in this repo.
